<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Reset Password Akun Anda</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#eef3f7;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">Permintaan reset password akun <%= brandName %> Anda. Tautan berlaku 1 jam.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#eef3f7;padding:24px 12px;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(11,95,165,.12);">
<tr><td style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b5fa5 0%,#0e7a5f 60%,#16a34a 100%);padding:28px 32px;text-align:center;">
<% if (logoUrl) { %><img src="<%= logoUrl %>" alt="<%= brandName %>" style="max-height:56px;max-width:220px;margin-bottom:10px;" /><br /><% } %>
<div style="font-size:36px;line-height:1;">🔐</div>
<div style="color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.3px;margin-top:6px;">Reset Password</div>
<div style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:13px;margin-top:4px;"><%= brandName %> &times; V-Green</div>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 8px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px;color:#0f2a43;">Halo <strong><%= userName %></strong>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#3d5469;">Kami menerima permintaan reset password untuk akun <strong><%= userEmail %></strong>. Klik tombol di bawah untuk membuat password baru:</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:8px auto 20px;"><tr><td align="center" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b5fa5,#16a34a);border-radius:999px;">
<a href="<%= resetUrl %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 36px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;">🔑 Buat Password Baru</a>
</td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#3d5469;">Atau salin tautan ini ke browser:<br /><a href="<%= resetUrl %>" style="color:#0b5fa5;word-break:break-all;"><%= resetUrl %></a></p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:16px 0;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:12px;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#7f1d1d;">
⏰ Tautan berlaku <strong>1 jam</strong> &amp; hanya <strong>sekali pakai</strong>.<br />
🚫 Jika Anda <strong>tidak</strong> meminta reset, abaikan email ini — password Anda tetap aman. Pertimbangkan melapor ke admin bila curiga.
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e6edf3;text-align:center;">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#8aa0b4;"><strong><%= brandFull %></strong><br />Email otomatis dari info@knab.co.id — mohon tidak membalas langsung.<br />Butuh bantuan? Hubungi admin melalui kontak resmi kami di <a href="<%= appUrl %>" style="color:#0b5fa5;"><%= appUrl %></a>.</p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
